        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "soh",
          "text": "wrongful death",
          "marks": [
            "log"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "soi",
          "text": " claim when another party’s negligence, recklessness, or intentional act causes someone’s death. In Greeley, these cases often stem from vehicle collisions on Highway 34 and Highway 85, semi-truck crashes linked to the region’s heavy agricultural and energy sector traffic, and hazards on commercial or industrial property.",
          "marks": []
        }
