          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqc",
          "text": "Greeley wrongful death lawyer",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqd",
          "text": " helps sort through these eligibility rules early, since filing under the wrong party’s name can delay or jeopardize an otherwise valid claim. Weld County courts require documentation proving these family relationships, so gathering marriage certificates, birth records, and any beneficiary designations as soon as possible helps a family move forward, assuming the filing itself occurs before the clock runs out.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bqg",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqf",
          "text": "How Long Do You Have to File a Greeley Wrongful Death Case?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bqo",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lqi",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/colorado-wrongful-death-statute-of-limitations/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "lql",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://colorado.public.law/statutes/crs_13-80-102"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqh",
          "text": "Losing a family member brings enough to carry without also having to track a legal deadline, but Colorado’s ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqj",
          "text": "statute of limitations",
          "marks": [
            "lqi"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqk",
          "text": " gives families only a limited window to bring a wrongful death claim. Under",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqm",
          "text": " Colorado Revised Statutes Section 13-80-102",
          "marks": [
            "lql"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqn",
          "text": ", most cases must be filed within two years of the date of death. Missing this window generally means a family loses the right to seek compensation through the courts.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bqq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqp",
          "text": "A few situations can extend that time frame, such as a driver who fled the scene of a fatal crash. Because these exceptions are limited and fact-specific, a family should confirm whether one applies rather than assume it does. Evidence also fades quickly after a fatal accident. Surveillance footage gets deleted, vehicle data can be lost, and witness memories grow less reliable as time passes. Speaking with a lawyer early can help preserve that evidence and clarify what the case may involve.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bqs",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqr",
          "text": "What Compensation Can You Pursue in a Wrongful Death Claim in Greeley?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bqu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqt",
          "text": "Wrongful death compensation in Greeley generally falls into two broad categories, and both matter to a family rebuilding its financial future.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bqw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sqv",
          "text": "Economic damages may include:",
          "marks": []
        }
