        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "br4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sr3",
          "text": "Non-economic damages may include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "br6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sr5",
          "text": "Loss of companionship, guidance, and emotional support",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "br8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sr7",
          "text": "Grief and mental anguish, which Colorado law caps and periodically adjusts for inflation",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "brf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lra",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/are-wrongful-death-settlements-taxable/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sr9",
          "text": "In cases involving particularly reckless or intentional conduct, a court may also allow punitive damages meant to punish the wrongdoer rather than compensate the family directly, and whether those ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "srb",
          "text": "settlements are taxable",
          "marks": [
            "lra"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "src",
          "text": " depends on how each portion is classified under IRS rules. Determining the full value of a wrongful death claim often requires input from economists and other experts who can project what the deceased would have contributed to their family over a lifetime. A ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "srd",
          "text": "Greeley wrongful death lawyer",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sre",
          "text": " works to ensure no category of loss gets overlooked, because no family should have to guess at what it is owed.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "brh",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "srg",
          "text": "Talk to a Greeley Wrongful Death Attorney About Your Legal Options",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
